WEBVTT

00:00:00.315 --> 00:00:03.099
Map this fictional reminder process using the nine

00:00:03.234 --> 00:00:06.692
FLOW elements. A permitted practice case enters, and

00:00:06.737 --> 00:00:10.060
the launch check confirms active status, permission and

00:00:10.105 --> 00:00:13.294
session details. Name the primary training owner and

00:00:13.339 --> 00:00:16.598
backup. Prepare the practice reminder, then inspect the

00:00:16.642 --> 00:00:20.909
dispute condition. If a dispute appears, stop reminders,

00:00:21.268 --> 00:00:23.289
keep the case on hold and pass the

00:00:23.335 --> 00:00:26.119
relevant record to the owner. Close only when

00:00:26.164 --> 00:00:28.513
the permitted outcome is recorded. A wait state

00:00:28.603 --> 00:00:31.253
is not completion, and this example sends no

00:00:31.343 --> 00:00:32.281
real messages.
